# Shopify Storefront API credentials.
#
# Leave these unset to run the site with built-in mock data (no Shopify needed).
# Once your Shopify store is ready:
#   1. In Shopify admin, install a "Headless" / custom app and enable the Storefront API.
#   2. Copy your store domain and the public Storefront API access token below.
#   3. Make sure the Albea product exists with the handle matching SHOPIFY_PRODUCT_HANDLE.
#
# SHOPIFY_STORE_DOMAIN=your-store.myshopify.com
# SHOPIFY_STOREFRONT_ACCESS_TOKEN=shpat_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# SHOPIFY_PRODUCT_HANDLE=albea
